  "instructions": [
    "Whisk the yogurt, olive oil, lemon juice, salt, and pepper until smooth, then stir in the drained chickpeas and let sit at room temperature for 4 hours to ferment and infuse flavors.",
    "In a bowl, combine chopped mint, parsley, red onion, pumpkin seeds, and apricots.",
    "Fold the fermented chickpeas into the herb and seed mixture.",
    "Prepare the fried croquettes by mixing mashed chickpeas, chickpea flour, corn flour, egg, cumin, and chili powder until a dough forms.",
    "Shape the dough into small bite-sized cakes and deep fry them in hot oil at 180°C until golden brown, about 3 minutes per side.",
    "Drain the croquettes on paper towels.",
    "Assemble the salad by placing the chickpea-herb mixture on a plate and topping with the fried croquettes.",
    "Drizzle additional vinaigrette over the entire dish and serve immediately."
  ],
